  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;ANNE R MEYER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Anne R Meyer is a researcher known for her contributions to the field of health sciences and her involvement in various research projects at the Anschutz Medical Campus."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0281</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANSCHUTZ MEDICAL CAMPUS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Anschutz Medical Campus is a part of the University of Colorado, where Anne R Meyer conducted significant research and was part of a research team."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0281</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF COLORADO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"University of Colorado is an educational institution where Anne R Meyer worked and where the Anschutz Medical Campus is located."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0281</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CORE BUILDING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"CoRE Building is a building at Rutgers University where Anne R Meyer attended a seminar and interacted with other researchers."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0281</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RUTGERS UNIVERSITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Rutgers University is an educational institution where Anne R Meyer visited and participated in seminars at the CoRE Building."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0281</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DIMACS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"DIMACS is the Center for Discrete Mathematics and Theoretical Computer Science, where Anne R Meyer thrived due to its collaborative spirit."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0281</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. KAO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Kao is an expert on algorithmic game theory and a familiar face at DIMACS, known for his soft-spoken demeanor."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0281</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. PATEL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Patel is the charismatic leader of the cryptography group at DIMACS, engaging in discussions with graduate students."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0281</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BELL LABS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bell Labs is an industry giant that collaborates with DIMACS and has a researcher present at the seminar."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0281</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NEC&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"NEC is another industry giant that collaborates with DIMACS and has a representative present at the seminar."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0281</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PRINCETON UNIVERSITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Princeton University collaborates with DIMACS and has a presence at the seminar."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0281</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JOURNAL OF HEALTH SCIENCES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Journal of Health Sciences is a leading publication in the field of health sciences where Anne R Meyer's research has been published."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0281</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;APPROXIMATION ALGORITHMS FOR NP-HARD PROBLEMS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Approximation Algorithms for NP-Hard Problems is a topic of discussion at the seminar, involving both theoretical and practical applications."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0281</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LANKY, BESPECTACLED RESEARCHER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The lanky, bespectacled researcher from Bell Labs was present at the seminar, taking notes on a pad with the company's logo."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0281</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PRINCETON UNDERGRADUATE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Princeton undergraduate student was present at the seminar, excited about the topic of Approximation Algorithms for NP-Hard Problems."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0281</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SPEAKER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The speaker at the seminar presented on Approximation Algorithms for NP-Hard Problems, engaging the audience with theoretical breakthroughs."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0281</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NEC REPRESENTATIVE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A representative from NEC was present at the seminar, listening intently to the theoretical breakthroughs presented."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0281</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CROSS-POLLINATION OF IDEAS AND EXPERTISE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The cross-pollination of ideas and expertise is a key theme at DIMACS, fostering innovation and collaboration."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0281</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INTELLECTUAL CURIOSITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The atmosphere of intellectual curiosity at the CoRE Building is a driving force for research and innovation."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0281</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INTERDISCIPLINARY FABRIC&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The interdisciplinary fabric of DIMACS brings together diverse experts from various fields to collaborate and innovate."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0281</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RESEARCH COLLABORATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Research collaboration is a core aspect of DIMACS, fostering innovation and advancing knowledge."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0281</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PROFESSIONAL NETWORK&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The professional network at DIMACS includes renowned researchers and industry leaders, facilitating knowledge exchange and collaboration."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0281</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ACADEMIC COMMUNITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The academic community at Rutgers University and DIMACS is characterized by a culture of collaboration and intellectual exchange."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0281</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THEORETICAL BREAKTHROUGHS&quot;">
